flowchart TD
  RX[BLE GATT write callback] --> B{Packet length valid?}
  B -->|no| DROP[Reject packet]
  B -->|yes| COPY[Copy bounded fragment]
  COPY --> Q{RX queue has capacity?}
  Q -->|no| COUNT[Count queue drop]
  Q -->|yes| TASK[Protocol task]
  TASK --> FRAG[Validate lane/index/count and reassemble]
  FRAG --> COMPLETE{Complete frame?}
  COMPLETE -->|no| WAIT[Wait for next fragment or timeout]
  COMPLETE -->|yes| FRAME[Validate envelope length/version/CRC]
  FRAME --> DECODE[Decode protobuf and dispatch message]
  DECODE --> STATE[Update state / send response]
  STATE --> IPC[Bounded UI IPC queue]
  IPC --> RENDER[LVGL UI task and display HAL]
